msgid ""
msgstr "We are pleased to announce the release of version 1.0.0 of the `@ant-design/x` component library! This release marks the official stable version of the Ant Design X component library, which is based on Ant Design and provides a series of AI interaction components to help you quickly build AI dialogue interfaces."

msgid "Triton-Ascend 版本发布"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend Version Release"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 版本提供了一个稳定的代码基础快照，封装成可以通过 PyPI 轻松安装的二进制包。此外，版本发布代表着开发团队可以向社区正式宣布新功能的可用性、已完成的改进以及可能影响用户的变化（例如破坏性变更）。"
msgstr "The Triton-Ascend version provides a stable codebase snapshot, packaged as a binary that can be easily installed via PyPI. Additionally, the release signifies that the development team can formally announce to the community the availability of new features, completed improvements, and changes that may affect users (e.g., breaking changes)."

